		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_RIVAL_TALK_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>……たいせつな　ものは
じぶんの　ちからで　まもらないとな！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:54:25" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>……大切な　ものは
自分の　力で　守らないとな！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:54:32" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
