	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_RIVAL_TALK_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンしょうぶに　つよい　ヤツが
ただしいって　わけじゃないけど▽
まけたら　なにも　いえないよな？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:08:36" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:08" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモン勝負に　強い　ヤツが
正しい　って　わけじゃないけど▽
負けたら　なにも　いえないよな？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:08:31" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:08" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T13:15:19" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ライバル
</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:08" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:53:54" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_RIVAL_TALK_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>よるに　なって
しずまりかえった　とき▼
みみを　すませば
ポケモンの　あしおとが　きこえる▼
そういうのが　すき　なんだ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T09:02:56" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:08" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>夜に　なって
静まりかえった　とき▼
耳を　すませば
ポケモンの　足音が　きこえる▼
そういうのが　好きなんだ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T09:02:58" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:08" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T13:15:19" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ライバル
</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:08" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:53:54" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_RIVAL_TALK_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>じぶんに　じしんが　あれば
そして　ポケモンが　いてくれるなら▽
みちに　まようことも　たのしめるッ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:56:56" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:08" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>自分に　自信が　あれば
そして　ポケモンが　いてくれるなら▽
道に　迷うことも　楽しめるッ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:57:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:08" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T13:15:19" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ライバル
</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:08" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:53:54" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_RIVAL_TALK_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>どんな　ポケモンが　いたら
ほかの　ポケモンの　じゃくてんを▽
カバーできるか　かんがえてたんだ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:57:16" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:08" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>どんな　ポケモンが　いたら
他の　ポケモンの　弱点を▽
カバーできるか　考えてたんだ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:57:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:08" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T13:15:19" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ライバル
</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:08" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:53:54" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_RIVAL_TALK_06"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>どんな　りゆうが　あろうが
ひとの　ものを　とったら▽
どろぼう　だからなッ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-19T02:53:41" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:04:53" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>どんな　理由が　あろうが
人の　ものを　とったら▽
どろぼう　だからなッ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-19T02:53:46" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:04:53" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T13:15:19" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ライバル
</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:04:53" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:53:54" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_RIVAL_TALK_07"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>どんな　ふうに　そだてて
つよくしようか　かんがえるのは▽
たのしい　じかん　だよなッ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:55:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:04:53" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>どんな　風に　育てて
強くしようか　考えるのは▽
楽しい　時間だよなッ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:55:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:04:53" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T13:15:19" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ライバル
</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:04:53" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:56:15" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_RIVAL_TALK_08"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>このみで　いえば
すばやい　ポケモン　かな……？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T09:03:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:04:53" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>好みで　いえば
すばやい　ポケモン　かな……？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:10:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
