	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_RIVAL_SP_36"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>どんな　トーナメントでも
ゆうしょうは　すごいぜッ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-21T03:59:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-21T03:58:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>どんな　トーナメントでも
優勝は　すごいぜッ！▼</Text>
