				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>一言　だけだぞ▼
リバースマウンテン▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:12:48" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
