		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_RIVAL_SP_09"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いま　サザナミあたり　かな▼
そうだな……　ひさしぶりに
オマエと　しょうぶ　するかッ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T09:07:56" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>いま　サザナミあたり　かな▼
そうだな……　久しぶりに
オマエと　勝負するかッ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T09:07:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
