	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_RIVAL_SP_11"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ぶじ　か！▼
オレは　セイガイハ　だから
すぐには　いけないけど▽
オマエなら　だいじょうぶ　だろッ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T09:08:21" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>無事　か！▼
オレは　セイガイハ　だから
すぐには　行けないけど▽
オマエなら　大丈夫だろッ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T09:08:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
