			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>未使用</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-24T13:24:12" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ライバル
</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T09:27:03" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#404040</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_RIVAL_SP_30"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>１８ばんどうろに　いったか？▼
あそこで　きたえるのも
わるくない　はなしだと　おもうぜッ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T09:34:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T09:33:27" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>１８番道路に　行ったか？▼
あそこで　鍛えるのも
悪くない　話しだと　思うぜッ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T09:45:57" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T09:44:44" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>未使用</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-24T13:24:12" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ライバル
</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T09:27:03" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#404040</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_RIVAL_SP_31"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あのさ……　リバースマウンテンに
でかい　ほのおの　ポケモンが▽
いるって　きいたけど　ほんとかな？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T09:34:39" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T09:34:02" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あのさ……　リバースマウンテンに
でかい　ほのおの　ポケモンが▽
いるって　きいたけど　ほんとかな？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T09:45:37" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T09:44:44" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>未使用</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-24T13:24:14" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ライバル
</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T09:27:03" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#404040</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_RIVAL_SP_32"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>そっちは　どうだ？▼
……　……　……
……　……　……▼
そうか……
じゃあ　てつだってくれよ▼
オマエ　うみべのどうけつを
しらべてくれよッ！▼
そう　２１ばんすいどうの！
じゃあ　たのんだぜッ！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-02-03T02:21:30" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T09:32:08" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>そっちは　どうだ？▼
……　……　……
……　……　……▼
そうか……
じゃあ　手伝ってくれよ▼
オマエ　海辺の洞穴を
調べてくれよッ！▼
そう　２１番水道の！
じゃあ　頼んだぜッ！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-02-03T02:21:57" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T09:44:44" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>目的地メッセージ
・２２番道路でのアクロマのイベント後から
　２１番水道でライバルのイベント開始まで</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-02-03T02:09:16" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ライバル
</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T09:27:03" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-02-03T02:08:54" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData />
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_RIVAL_SP_33"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>もぐるぜッ　ジャイアントホール！
プラズマだんを　にがすかよッ！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-25T11:40:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T09:34:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>潜るぜッ　ジャイアントホール！
プラズマ団を　逃がすかよッ！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-25T11:40:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T09:44:44" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>目的地メッセージ
・ジャイアントホール進入イベントから
 ロット達とのイベントまでジ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-25T11:37:20" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ライバル
</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-18T09:32:10" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-25T11:37:23" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
