	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_CHELEN_GREET_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>どうしたの？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T06:07:02" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>どうしたの？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T06:07:01" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>チェレン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:30:14" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:59:28" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_CHELEN_TALK_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いいかい？▼
モンスターボールは　つねに
きらさない　ように　すること▼
いつ　どこで　どんな　ポケモンと
であうか　わからない▼
チャンスは　やってくると　しんじて
じゅんび　しておかないとね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T05:29:52" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>いいかい？▼
モンスターボールは　常に
きらさない　ように　すること▼
いつ　どこで　どんな　ポケモンと
出会うか　わからない▼
チャンスは　やってくると　信じて
準備して　おかないとね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:20:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:09" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>チェレン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:30:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:59:37" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_CHELEN_TALK_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンしょうぶでの
ほんとうの　はいぼくは▽
あきらめるってこと！▼
まけた　りゆうを　かんがえ
どう　おぎなうか　くふうする▼
そして　チャレンジしつづければ
まえの　じぶんを　こえられる▼
だけど　なにも　しなければ
ぜったいに　かてないからね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T05:34:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:50:59" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモン勝負での
本当の　敗北は▽
あきらめるってこと！▼
負けた　理由を　考え
どう　補うか　工夫する▼
そして　チャレンジしつづければ
前の　自分を　超えられる▼
だけど　なにも　しなければ
絶対に　勝てないからね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T06:07:19" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:50:59" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:09" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>チェレン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:50:57" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:59:37" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_CHELEN_TALK_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>うーん▼
ポケモンの　ちしきを
おしえるのも　だいじだけど▼
なにより　ポケモンと　いると
たのしいって　しってほしいな！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:22:04" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:02" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>うーん▼
ポケモンの　知識を
教えるのも　大事だけど▼
なにより　ポケモンと　いると
楽しいって　知ってほしいな！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:22:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:02" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:09" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>チェレン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:02" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:59:37" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_CHELEN_TALK_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>しんじつも……
りそうも……▼
ひとの　かず……　いや
ポケモンと　ひとの　かずだけ▽
あるんだよね　きっと▼
だから　せいかい　って
あるともいえるし　ないともいえるね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-02-02T14:09:56" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:02" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>真実も……
理想も……▼
人の　数……　いや
ポケモンと　人の　数だけ▽
あるんだよね　きっと▼
だから　正解って
あるともいえるし　ないともいえるね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-02-02T14:09:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:02" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:09" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>チェレン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:02" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:59:37" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_CHELEN_TALK_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ぼくが　メガネを　はずして
ベルが　メガネを　かけてて……▼
ひさしぶりに　あったとき
すごく　おどろいたよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T05:26:34" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:02" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ぼくが　メガネを　はずして
ベルが　メガネを　かけてて……▼
ひさしぶりに　会ったとき
すごく　驚いたよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:24:04" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:02" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:09" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>チェレン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:02" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:59:37" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_CHELEN_TALK_06"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>こどもの　ころ
めかくし　して　すごすという▽
じっけんを　したよ▼
そうすることで
かんかくが　きたえられる……▽
そんなふうに　かんがえていたんだ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T06:50:27" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:04" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>こどもの　ころ
目隠し　して　過ごすという▽
実験を　したよ▼
そうすることで
感覚が　鍛えられる……▽
そんな風に　考えていたんだ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:24:32" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:04" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:09" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>チェレン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:04" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:59:37" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_CHELEN_TALK_07"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ぼくのこと　だけど
ジムリーダーとして　おかしくない？▼
あっ
ゴメンゴメン！▼
そんなこと　こたえづらいよね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T05:23:50" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:04" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ぼくのこと　だけど
ジムリーダーとして　おかしくない？▼
あっ
ゴメンゴメン！▼
そんなこと　答えづらいよね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T06:07:39" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:04" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:09" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>チェレン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:04" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:59:37" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_CHELEN_TALK_08"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>じぶんに　じしんが　ないときは
チャンピオンとかの　かたがきで▽
じぶんを　ひょうげん　したくなるけど▽
それは　うわべの　ことなんだよね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T05:09:41" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:04" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>自分に　自信が　ないときは
チャンピオンとかの　肩書きで▽
自分を　表現したくなるけど▽
それは　上辺の　ことなんだよね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:25:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:04" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:09" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>チェレン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:04" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:59:37" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_CHELEN_TALK_09"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ちしきが　あっても
ちえが　ないと　ダメなのかもね▼
ちしきは　あくまでも　じょうほう
じょうほうを　どう　いかせるか？▽
それが　だいじだと　おもうんだ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T06:07:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:04" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>知識が　あっても
知恵が　ないと　ダメなのかもね▼
知識は　あくまでも　情報
情報を　どう　いかせるか？▽
それが　大事だと　思うんだ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:25:36" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:04" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:09" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>チェレン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:04" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:59:37" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_CHELEN_TALK_10"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>きになることは　しらべる
そして　じっさいに　たしかめる▼
あたま　だけで
わかったつもりで　いると▽
いろいろ　いたいめに　あうからね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T05:06:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:04" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>気になることは　調べる
そして　実際に　たしかめる▼
頭だけで
わかったつもりで　いると▽
いろいろ　痛い目に　あうからね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:26:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:04" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:09" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>チェレン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:04" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:59:37" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_CHELEN_BYE_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>じゃ　またね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T04:58:00" />
