	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_BELL_GREET_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>はいはーい！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T06:08:28" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>はいはーい！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T06:08:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment />
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:22" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ベル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:30:20" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:59:37" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_BELL_TALK_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>きょうは　どんな　かんじ？▼
いい　かんじ　だったら
すっごく　たのしいし▼
いまいち　だったら
あしたが　たのしくなる　はずだよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T06:09:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>きょうは　どんな　感じ？▼
いい　感じ　だったら
すっごく　楽しいし▼
いまいち　だったら
明日が　楽しくなる　はずだよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T06:09:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:29" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ベル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:30:23" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:59:37" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_BELL_TALK_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンと　であうため
くさむらに　はいるのって▽
いつになっても　ドキドキするよ▼
あの　きもち　いつまでも
ぜったいに　わすれないよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T05:28:50" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンと　出会うため
草むらに　入るのって▽
いつになっても　ドキドキするよ▼
あの気持ち　いつまでも
絶対に　忘れないよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:26:45" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:29" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ベル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:11" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:59:37" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_BELL_TALK_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>アララギはかせの　おてつだいで
たっくさん　ほんを　よんでいたら▽
メガネを　かけるように　なったの▼
あたしとしては
にあってるつもり　だよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:27:48" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>アララギ博士の　お手伝いで
たっくさん　本を　読んでいたら▽
メガネを　かけるように　なったの▼
あたしとしては
似合ってるつもり　だよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:27:39" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:29" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ベル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:15" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:59:37" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_BELL_TALK_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>モンスターボールを
１０こ　まとめて　かうとね▼
な　な　なんと！
プレミアボールを　１こ▽
もらえて　しまうんだよ！▼
すごいよねえ！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T05:23:16" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>モンスターボールを
１０個　まとめて　買うと▼
な　な　なんと！
プレミアボールを　１個▽
もらえて　しまうんだよ！▼
すごいよねえ！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:28:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:29" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ベル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:15" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:59:37" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_BELL_TALK_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ねえねえ　いきなりだけど
あたし　おもうの！▼
ともだちって　あえなくても
ともだち　だよね　きっと！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T06:09:34" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ねえねえ　いきなりだけど
あたし　思うの！▼
ともだちって　会えなくても
ともだち　だよね　きっと！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T06:09:36" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:29" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ベル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:15" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:59:37" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_BELL_TALK_06"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>えーっとね
むかしのこと　おもいだしてたの▼
といっても　そんな
むかしじゃなくて　というか▽
つい　さいきん　なのかな？▼
ポケモンを　もらって
ポケモンずかんを　たくされ▽
たびを　はじめたときの　ことだよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:31:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>えーっとね
昔のこと　思い出してたの▼
といっても　そんな
昔じゃなくて　というか▽
つい　最近　なのかな？▼
ポケモンを　もらって
ポケモン図鑑を　託され▽
旅を　はじめたときの　ことだよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:31:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:29" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ベル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:11" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:59:37" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData />
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_BELL_TALK_07"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ねえねえ▼
ポケモンと　はなせたら
うれしい？　それとも　こまる？▼
あたしは　じぶんの　ポケモンに
いつも　はなしかけてるけど▽
へんじしたら　どうするのかなあ？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:31:45" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ねえねえ▼
ポケモンと　話せたら
うれしい？　それとも　困る？▼
あたしは　自分の　ポケモンに
いつも　話しかけてるけど▽
返事したら　どうするのかなあ？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:31:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:29" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ベル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:11" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:59:37" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData />
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_BELL_TALK_08"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンの
いちばんの　ふしぎ……▼
それは　ひとと
いっしょに　いること！▼
それを　けんきゅうテーマに
しようかな　なんて　おもってるの▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:54:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンの
一番の　不思議……▼
それは　人と
一緒に　いること！▼
それを　研究テーマに
しようかな　なんて　思ってるの▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:32:37" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:29" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ベル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:11" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:59:37" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData />
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_BELL_TALK_09"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あたしはね
ポケモンの　けんきゅうを▽
はじめたばかり　というか▼
まだ　おてつだい　だけど
ぜったいに　ポケモンの　すべてを▽
ときあかすなんて　むりでしょ▼
それを　わかっていて
けんきゅうを　つづける　はかせって▽
すごいと　おもうんだよねえ……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:50:47" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あたしはね
ポケモンの　研究を▽
始めたばかり　というか▼
まだ　お手伝い　だけど
絶対に　ポケモンの　すべてを▽
解き明かすなんて　無理でしょ▼
それを　わかっていて
研究を　続ける　博士って▽
すごいと　尊敬するんだよねえ……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:33:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:29" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ベル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:11" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:59:37" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData />
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_BELL_TALK_10"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>……　……　……
……　……　……▼
ああ！　ごめんね▼
いま　きになる
ポケモンが　とびだしたから……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:47:27" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>……　……　……
……　……　……▼
ああ！　ごめんね▼
いま　気になる
ポケモンが　飛び出したから……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:33:36" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
