	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_MOTHER_GREET_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おっ
げんきそうな　こえね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:24:39" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>おっ
元気そうな　声ね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:24:48" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:30:39" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:59:37" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_MOTHER_TALK_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いっしょに　たびをする
ポケモンは　ふえたの？▼
たびは　にぎやかな　ほうが
ぜったいに　たのしいわよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:44:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>一緒に　旅をする
ポケモンは　増えたの？▼
旅は　にぎやかな　方が
絶対に　楽しいわよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:34:58" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:35" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:30:42" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:59:37" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_MOTHER_TALK_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>きょうの　こんだては
なにに　しようかなー？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:44:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:30" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>きょうの　献立は
なにに　しようかなー？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:35:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:30" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:35" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:28" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:59:37" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_MOTHER_TALK_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いろんな　ポケモンが　いて
おなじ　しゅるいの　ポケモンでも▽
せいかくとか　ぜんぜん　ちがうのよ▼
あなたに　ぴったりの
ポケモンは　どんな　ポケモンかな？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:35:33" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>いろんな　ポケモンが　いて
同じ　種類の　ポケモンでも▽
性格とか　ぜんぜん　違うのよ▼
あなたに　ぴったりの
ポケモンは　どんな　ポケモンかな？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:35:25" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:35" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
