	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_MOTHER_TALK_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンに　しんらい　されるには
まず　いっしょに　あるくこと！▼
そうすれば　あなたの
いろんなことを　しってもらえるわよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:32:39" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンに　信頼されるには
まず　一緒に　歩くこと！▼
そうすれば　あなたの
いろんなことを　知ってもらえるわよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:35:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:35" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:59:37" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_MOTHER_TALK_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いえの　ことは　だいじょうぶよ！▼
あなたが　いつ
かえってきても　いいように▼
ベッドの　シーツは
まいにち　あらってるから！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:41:56" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>いえの　ことは　大丈夫よ！▼
あなたが　いつ
帰ってきても　いいように▼
ベッドの　シーツは
毎日　洗ってるから！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:36:06" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:35" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:59:37" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_MOTHER_TALK_06"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いきなり　マジメに　なっちゃうけど▼
あなたが　うまれたとき
すでに　ポケモンは　いたよね▼
それって　あたりまえ　だけど
あたりまえの　ことを　なぜ？　って▽
かんがえるのも　たび　かもね？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:40:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>いきなり　マジメに　なっちゃうけど▼
あなたが　生まれたとき
すでに　ポケモンは　いたよね▼
それって　当たり前　だけど
当たり前の　ことを　なぜ？　って▽
考えるのも　旅かもね？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:36:28" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:35" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:59:37" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_MOTHER_TALK_07"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンセンターの
うけつけの　ひとはね　いがいと▽
トレーナーのこと　おぼえているのよ▼
もちろん　いっしょに　いる
ポケモンたちの　こともね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:33:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンセンターの
受付の　人はね　意外と▽
トレーナーのこと　覚えているのよ▼
もちろん　一緒に　いる
ポケモンたちの　こともね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:36:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:35" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:59:37" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_MOTHER_TALK_08"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモン　いっぱい　つかまえた？▼
じゃあ　たまには
ポケモンセンターの　ボックスを　みて▼
あなたと　たびを　したがっている
ポケモンが　いるかもよ？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:38:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモン　いっぱい　捕まえた？▼
じゃあ　たまには
ポケモンセンターの　ボックスを　みて▼
あなたと　旅を　したがっている
ポケモンが　いるかもよ？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:36:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:35" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:59:37" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_MOTHER_TALK_09"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンセンターは
みんなの　いえ！▼
そういうつもりで　えんりょなく
りよう　すれば　いいのよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:35:58" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンセンターは
みんなの　家！▼
そういうつもりで　遠慮なく
利用すれば　いいのよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:37:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:35" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:59:37" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_MOTHER_TALK_10"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おこづかいは　たりてる？▼
なんて　きいてみたけど
あなたなら　だいじょうぶ　よね！▼
だけど　ムダづかいは　だめよ
いざというとき　こまるから▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:36:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>おこづかいは　足りてる？▼
なんて　きいてみたけど
あなたなら　大丈夫よね！▼
だけど　無駄使いは　だめよ
いざというとき　困るから▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:37:32" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:35" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-07T09:59:37" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_MOTHER_BYE_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>はーい！
じゃあ　げんき　でねー！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
